<p><b>v1.4.10</b></p>
<ul>
  <li>Win11 jump lists, window previews, and tray flyouts now follow the mouse so they no longer open over the clock.</li>
</ul>
<div class="warning">
  <div class="warning-title">⚠️ Accessibility Permission</div>
  <p>Builds use a stable code signature. If merge-windows / title display stop working after this update: System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Accessibility → select RetroWin → <b>−</b>, relaunch, and Allow again. Later updates with the same signature should keep the grant.</p>
</div>
